    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description><![CDATA[A beautiful client for Plex & Jellyfin

Stream your media library with HDR, Dolby Vision, offline downloads, and a gorgeous experience across all your devices.

**Features**

- Wide Codec Support
- HDR10+
- Subtitles
- Cross-Platform
- Offline
- Watch Together
- Tracker Sync
- Skip intros
- Chapter support
- Gestures
]]></description>
    <summary>A modern client for Plex and Jellyfin on desktop, mobile, and TV. Built with Flutter for native performance and a clean interface.</summary>
    <releaseNotes><![CDATA[[Releases](https://github.com/edde746/plezy/releases)

## Playback

- Large MKVs on Android resume and seek immediately
- Dolby Vision plays through the Dolby Vision decoder on Android
- Opus, Vorbis, and FLAC tracks play instead of stalling on Android

## Downloads

- An unreachable downloaded file streams from the server on Android

## Profiles & startup

- The profile prompt no longer interrupts a companion-remote session

## tvOS

- Siri Remote navigation matches native tvOS pacing
- A single flick moves exactly one item
- Rail and hub-row scrolling glides instead of snapping]]></releaseNotes>
